"Getting started"

TopDOOM ships with the shareware DOOM1.WAD and Freedoom, so there is a full game to play without owning one. 
Your own DOOM, DOOM II or any add-on built on them goes in beside them: 
pick it on the New Game tab, or open the WAD Library there to browse a folder of your own.



